        -:  684:/* ================================================================
        -:  685: * UTF-8 slice-boundary audit — COUNTING MODE (stage 1)
        -:  686: *
        -:  687: * Bug: text slicing splits UTF-8 mid-codepoint and stores the invalid bytes
